# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installation instructions for the latest version of Qiskit Paulice"
msgstr "Pokyny k instalaci nejnovější verze Qiskit Paulice"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installation instructions"
msgstr "Pokyny k instalaci"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installation instructions {#installation-instructions}"
msgstr "Pokyny k instalaci {#installation-instructions}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prerequisites {#prerequisites}"
msgstr "Předpoklady {#prerequisites}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "First, create a minimal environment with only Python installed in it. We recommend using [Python virtual environments](https://docs.python.org/3.10/tutorial/venv.html).\n"
msgstr "Nejprve vytvoř minimální prostředí, ve kterém je nainstalovaný pouze Python. Doporučujeme používat [virtuální prostředí Pythonu](https://docs.python.org/3.10/tutorial/venv.html).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Activate your new environment.\n"
msgstr "Aktivuj své nové prostředí.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "There are two primary ways to install this package: from PyPI or from source. The preferred method is to install from PyPI:\n"
msgstr "Tento balíček lze nainstalovat dvěma hlavními způsoby: z PyPI nebo ze zdrojového kódu. Preferovanou metodou je instalace z PyPI:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install from PyPI {#install-from-pypi}"
msgstr "Instalace z PyPI {#install-from-pypi}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install from source {#install-from-source}"
msgstr "Instalace ze zdrojového kódu {#install-from-source}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you plan to develop in the repository or run the notebooks locally, you should install from source.\n"
msgstr "Pokud plánuješ vyvíjet v repozitáři nebo spouštět notebooky lokálně, měl bys instalovat ze zdrojového kódu.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "First, clone the `qiskit-paulice` repository.\n"
msgstr "Nejprve naklonuj repozitář `qiskit-paulice`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next, install the Rust toolchain, upgrade pip, and enter the repository. Refer to the [Rust documentation](https://www.rust-lang.org/tools/install) for instructions on installing the toolchain.\n"
msgstr "Dále nainstaluj toolchain Rustu, aktualizuj pip a přejdi do repozitáře. Pokyny k instalaci toolchainu najdeš v [dokumentaci Rustu](https://www.rust-lang.org/tools/install).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The next step is to install `qiskit-paulice` to the virtual environment. If you plan to run the notebooks and their visualizations, install the notebook dependencies. If you plan on developing in the repository, install the `dev` dependencies.\n"
msgstr "Dalším krokem je instalace `qiskit-paulice` do virtuálního prostředí. Pokud plánuješ spouštět notebooky a jejich vizualizace, nainstaluj závislosti pro notebooky. Pokud plánuješ vyvíjet v repozitáři, nainstaluj závislosti `dev`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Adjust the options below to suit your needs.\n"
msgstr "Upravte níže uvedené volby podle svých potřeb.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you installed the notebook dependencies, you can get started by running the notebooks in the docs.\n"
msgstr "Pokud jsi nainstaloval závislosti pro notebooky, můžeš začít spuštěním notebooků v dokumentaci.\n"
